        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Barranca de Oblatos\n- People: Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa\n- Topics: dams, rivers, inaugurations\n\nFacts:\n- Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa served as President of Mexico from 2006 to 2012.\n- A dam was completed in January 2012.\n- Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa inaugurated the dam after its completion in January 2012.\n- The dam is located on the river that carved Barranca de Oblatos.",
